B.2.6.0100. - Project Level: The system shall allow the ability to add, edit or delete user access to application tools for Basic Privileges and expiration date.
B.2.6.0200. - Project Level: The system shall allow data entry form user access to be (No Access / Read Only / View & Edit / Edit survey responses).
B.2.6.0300. - Project Level: The system shall allow instrument level data export rights to be (No Access, De-Identified, Remove All Identifier Fields, Full Data Set).
B.2.6.0400. - Project Level: The system shall allow for the creation, copying and deletion of user roles.
B.2.6.0500. - Project Level: The system shall support adding and removing users from user roles.
B.2.6.0600. - User Interface: The system shall support instrument level delete privileges.
A.2.6.0700. - Control Center - User Settings: The system shall support a system-level policy controlling whether users without existing REDCap accounts may be added to projects.